properties.statement:
Recorded so a regression is checkable. Reporter (the hxm_program hub, 2026-09-28): "/where's shape is right for a returning operator. It says what is settled, what is delivered, and what was already asked (in the wording the user saw). 'Nothing has changed since last time' was a legitimate one-line answer, and the skill explicitly permits it."
What must not regress:
· the three bands;
· questions quoted in the words the user saw;
· permission to give a one-line answer.
A QUALIFICATION, from the day's other triage: fact:root-cause-no-served-read-answers-since-last-time-2026-09-28 measured that no served read computes "since last time". So "nothing has changed" is an answer the skill permits, not one a read established, and a same-day revision would not have shown. The same report also found /where failing wholesale when several of its roughly eight reads were unavailable (F-36, triaged separately).
